cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the EVENTSKG dataset in your work or research, please cite it as below."
title: "EVENTSKG: A 5-Star Dataset of Top-Ranked Events in Eight Computer Science Communities"
abstract: "EVENTSKG (formerly EVENTS) is a 5-star Linked Open Dataset representing comprehensive semantic descriptions of top-tier scientific events in computer science. It encompasses detailed information regarding event series, individual editions, publications, submissions, key dates, locations, and official homepages across 73 conference series."
